       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORM-LOOPS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01 TOTAL-VALUE PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM DISPLAY-HELLO 3 TIMES.
           PERFORM ADD-NUMBER UNTIL COUNTER-VALUE = 10.
           DISPLAY "SUM OF 1 TO 10: " TOTAL-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
       DISPLAY-HELLO.
           DISPLAY "HELLO FROM COBOL".
       ADD-NUMBER.
           ADD 1 TO COUNTER-VALUE.
           ADD COUNTER-VALUE TO TOTAL-VALUE.
